181
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:49,720
If volleyball was a game of one-on-one,

182
00:11:50,020 --> 00:11:53,280
there's no way we would hold our own against Shira Torrezzano.

183
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:57,640
We're smaller in stature and have a lot less individual attack power.

184
00:11:58,120 --> 00:12:03,080
But there's six of us on the court, so we won't have to rely on miracles to win.

185
00:12:03,820 --> 00:12:05,840
Our forte is our teamwork.

186
00:12:06,520 --> 00:12:08,020
So let's win this together.

187
00:12:08,620 --> 00:12:09,000
Yeah!

188
00:12:10,800 --> 00:12:12,880
