233
00:15:17,980 --> 00:15:20,640
This guy is definitely some kind of monster.

234
00:15:21,340 --> 00:15:23,040
Maybe even some kind of mutant.

235
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:26,580
But the name that comes to my mind first for him is...

236
00:15:26,580 --> 00:15:26,980
Alright.

237
00:15:29,620 --> 00:15:31,780
An absolute fool for volleyball.

238
00:15:34,200 --> 00:15:39,160
Serves up!

239
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:40,660
Now bring it!

240
00:15:46,800 --> 00:15:48,040
Crap, too short!

241
00:15:48,580 --> 00:15:49,260
It'll work.

242
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:51,420
